# AI assistant
# Claude Code splits shared from personal BY FILENAME, not by directory:
# `.claude/settings.json` is meant to be committed, `settings.local.json` is not.
# So share the project-scoped config and keep only the per-person files local.
.claude/*
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/settings.json
# .codex/ stays fully ignored until there is something shareable in it.
.codex/

**/.flyte